{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/e55bcd912d0fed358360885ad8ac1453.avif?t=1755140242\" width=789 height=207 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel world. Hand Painted combat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a challenging pixel-art overworld, then clash in <strong>hand-drawn, visually striking battles</strong> that bring your cultivation techniques to life. <strong>No bland animations\u2014just raw, aesthetic power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/0ca9efd5daca7635c3226f6d78f39a99.poster.avif?t=1755140242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/0ca9efd5daca7635c3226f6d78f39a99.webm?t=1755140242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/0ca9efd5daca7635c3226f6d78f39a99.mp4?t=1755140242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is your most precious resource.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the <strong>Seclude </strong>feature at any moment to upgrade your deck,   gain EXP and heals\u2014but <strong>every step ages you</strong>. Will you burn bright and fast, or live long enough to ascend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/ea00ec943293b2fb5bccbb421000fc73.poster.avif?t=1755140242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/ea00ec943293b2fb5bccbb421000fc73.webm?t=1755140242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/ea00ec943293b2fb5bccbb421000fc73.mp4?t=1755140242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hundreds of cards, relics, and upgrades\u2014just the beginning.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am actively updating and listening to feedback. <strong>Join our Discord and help shape the future of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/a815435727b2a3b7b455f7cc256fccd5.poster.avif?t=1755140242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/a815435727b2a3b7b455f7cc256fccd5.webm?t=1755140242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/a815435727b2a3b7b455f7cc256fccd5.mp4?t=1755140242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159440?t=1755140242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/ebf62e52c06d16e4a2fdb22a039eafec319037fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755140242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/1bf0c791229ae6d3cea2e79a2f60ec53eeecd177/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755140242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/1bf0c791229ae6d3cea2e79a2f60ec53eeecd177/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755140242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Viole